      "updated": 1780093023030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGEND   —   ■ violet: orchestrator    ■ blue: sub-agent    ■ green: data source / system\n■ orange: decision point (diamond)    ■ pink: human / hold    ■ gray-dashed: external context\nSolid arrow = command / control flow      Blue dashed = data link      Orange = feeds a decision\nPurple dashed = flash-promo trigger        Green dashed = execution loop back to acting agent",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box86",
      "originalText": "LEGEND   —   ■ violet: orchestrator    ■ blue: sub-agent    ■ green: data source / system\n■ orange: decision point (diamond)    ■ pink: human / hold    ■ gray-dashed: external context\nSolid arrow = command / control flow      Blue dashed = data link      Orange = feeds a decision\nPurple dashed = flash-promo trigger        Green dashed = execution loop back to acting agent",
